        "content": "## 1. Telegram Receipt Submission & Image Prep\n\nReceives receipt images submitted by the user through Telegram. The trigger also downloads the actual image (large size) and makes it available as binary image data for processing.\n\n**Passes to next step:** binary receipt image + Telegram message metadata (chat id, submission date).",
